exercises.prompt:
What does this print?

logged_in = True
is_admin = True
if logged_in:
    if is_admin:
        print("Admin panel")
    else:
        print("User page")
else:
    print("Please log in")

Same code, but is_admin = False. What prints?

logged_in = True
is_admin = False
if logged_in:
    if is_admin:
        print("Admin panel")
    else:
        print("User page")
else:
    print("Please log in")

Same code, but logged_in = False. What prints?

logged_in = False
is_admin = True
if logged_in:
    if is_admin:
        print("Admin panel")
    else:
        print("User page")
else:
    print("Please log in")

